         "Model picker:\n  Startup, global users, no DC -> public cloud\n  Bank, trading engine <1ms from exchange -> hybrid (on-prem + cloud burst)\n  Classified data, air-gapped law -> private/on-prem\n  5-year migration -> hybrid, shrinking on-prem\n\nConstraint picks the model.",
